                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0r7s9a50e39194120rgm40izxszy (copy 2)].[none:chain_name:nk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'><![CDATA[<[federated.0r7s9a50e39194120rgm40izxszy (copy 2)].[:Measure Names]>:	]]></run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0r7s9a50e39194120rgm40izxszy (copy 2)].[Multiple Values]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b20e51' underline='true'>GLOSSARY</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>1) # PB orders: &#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Number of pandabox orders</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>2) # PB new cust: &#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Number of new customers from pandabox</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>3) # PB winback cust: &#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Number of customers from pandabox that have previously ordered from vendor 	     </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>4) PB GFV (Local): &#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>GFV of pandabox orders</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>5) PB reorders:&#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'># of reorders from the pandabox order in the month</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>6) PB reorders GFV (Local):  </run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>GFV of reorders from pandabox order in the month</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>7) Total PB cost (Local):         </run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Total cost of vendor buying pandabox (pandabox fee + voucher fee)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>8) CAC (Local): </run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Total cost of pandabox / number of pandabox customers</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>9) % PB customers: &#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Number of pandabox customers / number of normal customers</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51'>10) % PB orders: &#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b20e51' italic='true'>Number of pandabox orders / number of normal orders</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
